      {
        "id": "model-operations-worked",
        "moduleId": "set-operations",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "模型补充：同一对集合上的四种运算",
        "markdown": "沿用教材 Example 3.2.8 的数据：宇集 X = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6}，A = {1, 2, 3}，B = {2, 4, 6}。逐项计算如下。A ∪ B = {1, 2, 3, 4, 6}；A ∩ B = {2}；A ∖ B = {1, 3}；B ∖ A = {4, 6}；Bᶜ = {1, 3, 5}。可以看到 A ∖ B 与 B ∖ A 一般不同，且 (A ∖ B) ∩ (B ∖ A) = ∅。再用补集核对：A ∩ Bᶜ = {1, 2, 3} ∩ {1, 3, 5} = {1, 3} = A ∖ B。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-operations-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-operations-properties",
        "moduleId": "set-operations",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：包含保持与等价刻画",
        "markdown": "Proposition 3.2.3：若 A ⊆ B 且 C ⊆ D，则 A ∩ C ⊆ B ∩ D 且 A ∪ C ⊆ B ∪ D。Corollary 3.2.4 给出常用特例：若 A ⊆ B 且 A ⊆ C，则 A ⊆ B ∩ C；若 D ⊆ A 且 E ⊆ A，则 D ∪ E ⊆ A。Proposition 3.2.5 用运算刻画包含：A ⊆ B、A ∩ B = A、A ∪ B = B 三者等价。并、交满足交换律与结合律，并且彼此满足分配律。补集满足 Proposition 3.2.9 的对偶关系，例如 (A ∩ B)ᶜ = Aᶜ ∪ Bᶜ、(A ∪ B)ᶜ = Aᶜ ∩ Bᶜ，以及 A ⊆ B 当且仅当 Bᶜ ⊆ Aᶜ。",
        "provenance": {
